     "\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div vlink=\"#954F72\" link=\"#0563C1\" lang=\"EN-GB\">\r\n<div style=\"direction:ltr;font-family:Tahoma;color:#000000;font-size:12pt\">\r\n<div>Dear all,</div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>please check out this interesting-sounding PhD opportunity.</div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>Best regards  -- Marc</div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Times New Roman;color:#000000;font-size:16px\">\r\n<hr>\r\n<div style=\"direction:ltr\"><font size=\"2\" face=\"Tahoma\" color=\"#000000\"><b>From:</b> <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">ncse-membe...@st-andrews.ac.uk</a> [<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">ncse-membe...@st-andrews.ac.uk</a>] on behalf of Emily Dennis [<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">ede...@butterfly-conservation.org</a>]<br>\r\n<b>Sent:</b> 26 October 2020 12:57<br>\r\n<b>To:</b> &#39;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">ncse...@st-andrews.ac.uk</a>&#39;<br>\r\n<b>Subject:</b> [ncse-members] [ncse-all] ARIES PhD studentship at the University of Kent<br>\r\n</font><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div></div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\" lang=\"EN-US\">Please circulate this ARIES PhD opportunity to any interested individuals.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\" lang=\"EN-US\"> </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\" lang=\"EN-US\">Many thanks,</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\" lang=\"EN-US\">Emily</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\" lang=\"EN-US\"> </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\" lang=\"EN-US\">Modelling Citizen-science Data for Butterflies and Moths: Where and When are they Flying?</span></b></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\" lang=\"EN-US\"> </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\" lang=\"EN-US\">Further details can be found here:\r\n<a href=\"https://www.aries-dtp.ac.uk/studentships/matechou/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.aries-dtp.ac.uk/studentships/matechou/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792450314458000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1hb2BHsyMiIaAHlcMUcgcx\">\r\nhttps://www.aries-dtp.ac.uk/studentships/matechou/</a> </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\" lang=\"EN-US\"> </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\" lang=\"EN-US\">The student will be based in the statistical ecology group at the University of Kent, supervised by Dr Eleni Matechou, Prof Byron Morgan and Dr Diana Cole, in collaboration\r\n with Dr Emily Dennis and Dr Richard Fox from Butterfly Conservation. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\" lang=\"EN-US\"> </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\" lang=\"EN-US\">The deadline for applications is 12<sup>th</sup> January 2021.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\" lang=\"EN-US\"> </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\" lang=\"EN-US\"> </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\" lang=\"EN-US\"> </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\"> </span></p>\r\n<table style=\"width:777.75pt;border-collapse:collapse\" width=\"1037\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"height:7.1pt\">\r\n<td colspan=\"5\" style=\"width:777.95pt;border:none;border-top:dotted windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;height:7.1pt\" width=\"1037\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:7.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#45a264\"> </span></b></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td rowspan=\"5\" style=\"width:76.35pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt\" width=\"102\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:center\" align=\"center\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#45a264\"><img src=\"https://groups.google.com/group/unmarked/attach/4e571220d4ba8/image001.jpg?part=0.1&amp;view=1\" alt=\"cid:ima...@01D2CB1C.DE13D450\" style=\"width:.9791in;min-height:.927in\" width=\"94\" height=\"89\" border=\"0\"></span></b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\"></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td colspan=\"4\" style=\"width:701.6pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt\" width=\"935\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#45a264\">Dr Emily Dennis\r\n</span></b><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\">Ecological Statistician</span></b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\"></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td colspan=\"4\" style=\"width:701.6pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt\" width=\"935\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-autospace:none\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\">Email:\r\n</span></b><span style=\"color:#1f497d\"><a href rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" data-email-masked><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:blue\">ede...@butterfly-conse